#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:34
msgid ""
"One confirmed documentation mismatch: `reset_workflow_state` says its "
"fingerprint includes a hash of the deleted state, but the typed "
"fingerprint and emitted payload contain only optional schema version, "
"write time, byte length, reason class, and recovered bucket ID. No "
"content hash is computed in these modules. Align the description with "
"actual fields or add the promised digest if downstream audit relies on "
"it. persistence.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) "
"events.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`)"
msgstr ""
"Egy megerősített dokumentációs eltérés: a `reset_workflow_state` szerint "
"az ujjlenyomata a törölt állapot hashértékét tartalmazza, de a típusos "
"ujjlenyomat és a kibocsátott tartalom csak opcionális sémaverziót, írási "
"időt, bájthosszt, okosztályt és helyreállított rekeszazonosítót "
"tartalmaz. Ezek a modulok nem számítanak tartalmi hashértéket. Igazítsd a"
" leírást a tényleges mezőkhöz, vagy add hozzá az ígért kivonatot, ha a "
"későbbi audit erre támaszkodik. persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:36
msgid "Resume and assessment"
msgstr "Folytatás és értékelés"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:38
msgid ""
"Resume first captures an exact persisted run and permits a fresh attempt "
"only when it is terminally aborted, has an obligation and an abort "
"reason, and is not a designed terminal case (`NO_PENDING_OBLIGATION`, "
"`ALREADY_FILED`, `USER_CANCELLED`). Selectors support exact run ID, work-"
"unit ID, calculation-revision ID, or a complete visible "
"modelo/year/period target. Model work-addressing remains the authority "
"for revision and period resolution; multiple natural-key candidates are "
"shown as an ambiguity rather than guessed. resume.py "
